            <title>[IGNITE-26803] Cache dump check fail on other node</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-26803</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Check procedure faile when dump checked on other node.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
